    q: 'How do I convert European (EU) shoe size to centimeters (CM)?',
    a: 'To convert shoe size EU to CM, you can reference our verified chart or use the Paris Point calculation. Under the European system, each EU size equals two-thirds of a centimeter (0.667 cm). After accounting for internal last allowance (toe clearance), a men\'s EU 42 equals 27.0 cm foot length, an EU 43 equals 28.0 cm, and a women\'s EU 38 equals 24.0 cm.'
  },
  {
    q: 'What is a 10.5 feet size in European shoe sizing?',
    a: 'A 10.5 feet size in European sizing translates according to gender and unit: An American Men\'s US 10.5 equals European EU 44.0 (fitting a 28.5 cm foot length). An American Women\'s US 10.5 equals European EU 42.5 (fitting a 27.5 cm foot length). If you have an anatomical foot length of 10.5 inches (26.67 cm), that corresponds to European EU 41.5 to EU 42.'
