  {
    q: 'How do EU feet sizes convert to US shoe sizes?',
    a: 'When translating EU feet size to US footwear, men subtract roughly 33 from their European number (for example, EU 42 − 33 = US Men 9.0), while women subtract roughly 31 (for example, EU 38 − 31 = US Women 7.0). For exact conversions across different sneaker brands, always cross-reference foot length in centimeters.'
