    q: 'Why are centimeters (CM) more accurate than European shoe sizes?',
    a: 'Centimeters provide an immutable metric measurement of your foot from heel to longest toe. While European shoe sizes can vary slightly between manufacturers (such as narrow Italian designer lasts versus wider German Birkenstocks), centimeters reflect the physical footbed space inside the shoe.'
