                  <th>EU Shoe Size</th>
                  <th>Foot Length (CM)</th>
                  <th>Millimeters (MM)</th>
                  <th>Inches</th>
                  <th>US Men Size</th>
                  <th>UK Men Size</th>
                </tr>
